{"seq":1,"slug":"native-modules","title":"React Native 原生模块开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/native-integration/native-modules","wordCount":848,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"react-native-原生模块开发\">React Native 原生模块开发</h1><p>当 React Native 的内置组件和 JavaScript 层无法满足需求时——读取设备传感器、调用平台 API、调用现有的原生 SDK——就需要编写原生模块（Native Modules）来桥接 JavaScript 与原生代码。本文覆盖旧版 NativeModules API 的工作方式（理解遗留代码必需）以及新架构下的 TurboModule 实现规范。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>NativeModules（旧架构）</strong>：React Native 旧版原生模块系统，通过 Bridge 传递消息，所有调用均为异步；iOS 实现用 Objective-C/Swift，Android 用 Java/Kotlin。</li>\n<li><strong>TurboModules（新架构）</strong>：新版原生模块系统，通过 JSI 直接调用，支持同步和异步，由 Codegen 从 TypeScript Spec 自动生成接口绑定代码。</li>\n<li><strong>@ReactMethod</strong>（Android）/ <code>RCT_EXPORT_METHOD</code>（iOS）：将原生方法暴露给 JavaScript 的注解/宏，旧架构使用；新架构通过继承 Codegen 生成的抽象类/协议实现。</li>\n<li><strong>Promise 回调</strong>：原生模块异步操作的标准返回方式；在 Android 中通过 <code>Promise</code> 参数、在 iOS 中通过 <code>RCTPromiseResolveBlock</code> / <code>RCTPromiseRejectBlock</code> 实现。</li>\n<li><strong>事件发射器（Event Emitter）</strong>：原生侧主动向 JavaScript 推送事件的机制（相对于 JS 主动调用原生的模块调用），用于实时传感器数据、推送通知接收等场景。</li>\n<li><strong>Spec 文件</strong>：TurboModule 的 TypeScript 接口定义文件，Codegen 的输入；必须符合严格的格式约束（不支持联合类型、泛型等高级 TypeScript 特性）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"旧版-nativemodules-理解遗留代码\">旧版 NativeModules：理解遗留代码</h2><p>虽然新项目应该直接使用 TurboModules，但大量现有库和项目仍使用旧版 API。理解它是维护遗留代码的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>iOS 实现（Objective-C）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"objc\" data-code=\"// RCTCalendarModule.h&#10;#import &lt;React/RCTBridgeModule.h&gt;&#10;&#10;@interface RCTCalendarModule : NSObject &lt;RCTBridgeModule&gt;&#10;@end&#10;&#10;// RCTCalendarModule.m&#10;#import &quot;RCTCalendarModule.h&quot;&#10;&#10;@implementation RCTCalendarModule&#10;&#10;RCT_EXPORT_MODULE(CalendarModule);  // 注册模块名&#10;&#10;// 异步方法：返回 void，通过 callback 或 Promise 传回结果&#10;RCT_EXPORT_METHOD(createEvent:(NSString *)title&#10;                  location:(NSString *)location&#10;                  resolve:(RCTPromiseResolveBlock)resolve&#10;                  reject:(RCTPromiseRejectBlock)reject)&#10;{&#10;  // 在后台线程执行&#10;  NSString *eventId = [self.calendarService createEvent:title location:location];&#10;  if (eventId) {&#10;    resolve(eventId);&#10;  } else {&#10;    reject(@&quot;create_failed&quot;, @&quot;Failed to create event&quot;, nil);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 同步方法（限制严格：必须在 JS 线程执行，会阻塞）&#10;RCT_EXPORT_SYNCHRONOUS_TYPED_METHOD(NSNumber *, getDeviceYear) {&#10;  return @([[NSCalendar currentCalendar] component:NSCalendarUnitYear&#10;                                          fromDate:[NSDate date]]);&#10;}&#10;&#10;@end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// RCTCalendarModule.h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#import &#x3C;React/RCTBridgeModule.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@interface RCTCalendarModule : NSObject &#x3C;RCTBridgeModule></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// RCTCalendarModule.m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#import \"RCTCalendarModule.h\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@implementation RCTCalendarModule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RCT_EXPORT_MODULE(CalendarModule);  // 注册模块名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 异步方法：返回 void，通过 callback 或 Promise 传回结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RCT_EXPORT_METHOD(createEvent:(NSString *)title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  location:(NSString *)location</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  resolve:(RCTPromiseResolveBlock)resolve</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  reject:(RCTPromiseRejectBlock)reject)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 在后台线程执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  NSString *eventId = [self.calendarService createEvent:title location:location];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (eventId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resolve(eventId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    reject(@\"create_failed\", @\"Failed to create event\", nil);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 同步方法（限制严格：必须在 JS 线程执行，会阻塞）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RCT_EXPORT_SYNCHRONOUS_TYPED_METHOD(NSNumber *, getDeviceYear) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return @([[NSCalendar currentCalendar] component:NSCalendarUnitYear</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                          fromDate:[NSDate date]]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@end</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Android 实现（Kotlin）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// CalendarModule.kt&#10;class CalendarModule(reactContext: ReactApplicationContext) :&#10;    ReactContextBaseJavaModule(reactContext) {&#10;&#10;    override fun getName() = &quot;CalendarModule&quot;  // 与 iOS 模块名一致&#10;&#10;    @ReactMethod&#10;    fun createEvent(title: String, location: String, promise: Promise) {&#10;        try {&#10;            val eventId = calendarService.createEvent(title, location)&#10;            promise.resolve(eventId)&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            promise.reject(&quot;create_failed&quot;, &quot;Failed to create event&quot;, e)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 事件发射器支持&#10;    private fun sendEvent(eventName: String, params: WritableMap) {&#10;        reactApplicationContext&#10;            .getJSModule(DeviceEventManagerModule.RCTDeviceEventEmitter::class.java)&#10;            .emit(eventName, params)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// CalendarPackage.kt——注册模块&#10;class CalendarPackage : ReactPackage {&#10;    override fun createNativeModules(context: ReactApplicationContext) =&#10;        listOf(CalendarModule(context))&#10;&#10;    override fun createViewManagers(context: ReactApplicationContext) =&#10;        emptyList&lt;ViewManager&lt;*, *&gt;&gt;()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// CalendarModule.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CalendarModule(reactContext: ReactApplicationContext) :</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ReactContextBaseJavaModule(reactContext) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getName() = \"CalendarModule\"  // 与 iOS 模块名一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ReactMethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun createEvent(title: String, location: String, promise: Promise) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val eventId = calendarService.createEvent(title, location)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            promise.resolve(eventId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            promise.reject(\"create_failed\", \"Failed to create event\", e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 事件发射器支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun sendEvent(eventName: String, params: WritableMap) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        reactApplicationContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .getJSModule(DeviceEventManagerModule.RCTDeviceEventEmitter::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .emit(eventName, params)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// CalendarPackage.kt——注册模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CalendarPackage : ReactPackage {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun createNativeModules(context: ReactApplicationContext) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        listOf(CalendarModule(context))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun createViewManagers(context: ReactApplicationContext) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emptyList&#x3C;ViewManager&#x3C;*, *>>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript 侧调用</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { NativeModules, NativeEventEmitter } from &#39;react-native&#39;;&#10;&#10;const { CalendarModule } = NativeModules;&#10;&#10;// 调用原生方法&#10;const eventId = await CalendarModule.createEvent(&#39;Team Meeting&#39;, &#39;Conference Room A&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 订阅原生事件&#10;const emitter = new NativeEventEmitter(CalendarModule);&#10;const subscription = emitter.addListener(&#39;CalendarEventCreated&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;Event created:&#39;, event);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 组件卸载时取消订阅&#10;return () =&gt; subscription.remove();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NativeModules, NativeEventEmitter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-native'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CalendarModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NativeModules;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 调用原生方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> eventId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CalendarModule.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Team Meeting'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Conference Room A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 订阅原生事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> emitter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NativeEventEmitter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CalendarModule);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> subscription</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emitter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CalendarEventCreated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Event created:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 组件卸载时取消订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subscription.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">remove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模块注册与包管理\">模块注册与包管理</h2><p>新架构下，原生模块的注册方式也发生了变化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    OldReg[旧架构注册\\nReactPackage → createNativeModules]&#10;    NewReg[新架构注册\\nTurboReactPackage → getModule]&#10;    AutoLink[自动链接\\n通过 react-native.config.js]&#10;&#10;    OldReg --&gt; AutoLink&#10;    NewReg --&gt; AutoLink\">graph LR\n    OldReg[旧架构注册\\nReactPackage → createNativeModules]\n    NewReg[新架构注册\\nTurboReactPackage → getModule]\n    AutoLink[自动链接\\n通过 react-native.config.js]\n\n    OldReg --&gt; AutoLink\n    NewReg --&gt; AutoLink</pre><p>大多数第三方库通过 React Native 的**自动链接（Auto Linking）**机制完成注册：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# iOS：pods 安装时自动链接&#10;cd ios &amp;&amp; pod install&#10;&#10;# Android：Gradle 构建时自动链接（通过 react-native.config.js）&#10;# 对于不支持自动链接的库，需要手动在 MainApplication.kt 注册\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># iOS：pods 安装时自动链接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ios</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Android：Gradle 构建时自动链接（通过 react-native.config.js）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对于不支持自动链接的库，需要手动在 MainApplication.kt 注册</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关于新架构的 TurboModules 规范写法，参见 <a href=\"turbo-modules-fabric\">Turbo Modules 与 Fabric 组件</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见原生能力模块示例\">常见原生能力模块示例</h2><p>以下是几类常见原生能力的实现模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力类型</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相机/相册</td>\n<td><code>react-native-vision-camera</code></td>\n<td>新架构原生支持，JSI 驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理位置</td>\n<td><code>@react-native-community/geolocation</code></td>\n<td>或使用 Expo Location</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推送通知</td>\n<td><code>@notifee/react-native</code></td>\n<td>支持 iOS/Android 全特性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生物识别</td>\n<td><code>react-native-biometrics</code></td>\n<td>Face ID / Touch ID / 指纹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝牙</td>\n<td><code>react-native-ble-plx</code></td>\n<td>BLE 协议，新架构兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密存储</td>\n<td><code>react-native-keychain</code></td>\n<td>iOS Keychain / Android Keystore</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件系统</td>\n<td><code>react-native-fs</code></td>\n<td>完整文件操作 API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选择第三方模块的评估维度</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>是否支持新架构（查看 README 或 <code>package.json</code> 中的 <code>react-native.newArchEnabled</code>）</li>\n<li>最近一次发布时间（超过 2 年未维护的库风险较高）</li>\n<li>iOS 和 Android 功能是否对等（部分库只完整实现了一个平台）</li>\n<li>TypeScript 类型支持质量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>原生模块是 React Native 能力扩展的关键机制，旧版 NativeModules 通过 Bridge 传递消息、新版 TurboModules 通过 JSI 直接调用——两者在接口设计上有相似性，但性能特征和类型安全保障有根本差异。</p>\n<p>对于新项目，应直接使用 TurboModules 规范（Spec 文件 + Codegen + JSI 实现），获得编译时类型检查和同步调用能力。对于维护现有 NativeModules 代码，互操作层允许它们继续工作，但建议制定迁移计划。</p>\n<p>选择第三方原生模块时，优先选择已宣布支持新架构的库；对于关键业务能力，评估其 iOS/Android 实现对等性和维护活跃度，而不只看 GitHub Star 数量。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"React Native 原生模块开发","id":"react-native-原生模块开发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"旧版 NativeModules：理解遗留代码","id":"旧版-nativemodules-理解遗留代码"},{"level":2,"text":"模块注册与包管理","id":"模块注册与包管理"},{"level":2,"text":"常见原生能力模块示例","id":"常见原生能力模块示例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"React Native 状态与数据管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/core-development/state-data-management"},"next":{"title":"Turbo Modules 与 Fabric：新架构原生集成规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/native-integration/turbo-modules-fabric"}}